horse brown~
a horse~
A brown horse moves about the herd, looking for some fresh grass.
~
A tall, dignified beast, this horse noses its way around the herd, looking for
some untrampled grass to feast upon.  Its muscles show under its skin as it
moves.  This looks like it would be a powerful mount.
